WEBVTT

00:00:01.490 --> 00:00:04.500
Okay, so the school theme for this month is ecology.

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:07.040
Our school will conserve goods and resources,

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.000
and together, strive to not waste anything.

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:13.840
We, the student council, have to take part in
these activities and set an example to follow.

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:18.470
Indeed, we'll have to be careful not to waste things.

00:00:18.890 --> 00:00:21.970
For the tsundere flat-chested
student council president Shino-chan,

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:24.930
any additional traits would be a complete waste.

00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:25.980
What was that?!

00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:30.940
Be sure to properly separate the trash.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:33.990
Who does this plastic bottle belong to?

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:36.240
It's empty, so I'm gonna toss it.

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.200
Oh, that's mine.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:39.280
Go ahead.

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:41.490
I guess you could say it's recycladorable.

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:43.120
Hold it right there.

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:45.580
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:49.290
All yours, President.

00:00:49.290 --> 00:00:51.090
I lost...

00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:53.210
Why am I so bad at this?

00:00:53.710 --> 00:00:57.010
You have a habit of always opening with scissors.

00:00:57.010 --> 00:00:57.970
Really?

00:00:58.340 --> 00:01:01.220
Must be because I've been
practicing the shocker lately.

00:01:01.220 --> 00:01:03.060
I'm not even going to ask what that is.

00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:08.900
Ousai Academy Student Council Rules:

00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:11.110
article two, clause ten!

00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:15.190
Only in erotic manga do you have too many random climaxes!

00:01:15.190 --> 00:01:16.900
This series isn't any better!

00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:55.380
Buying vegetables at a grocer's really helps to save money.

00:02:55.380 --> 00:02:58.090
Do you keep tabs on which places are cheaper?

00:02:58.090 --> 00:02:59.460
Of course.

00:02:59.460 --> 00:03:02.970
A truly capable woman should be able to buy ingredients on the cheap

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:04.550
and reduce the strain on the family budget.

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:07.510
I have seen the light!

00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:13.100
So yeah, we're here to pick vegetables on this mountain the Shichijous own.

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:14.350
Right.

00:03:24.660 --> 00:03:26.200
Welcome to Shichijou Hill.

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:29.910
How rare to see you not in your maid uniform, Dejima-san.

00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:32.960
It wouldn't be very good for hiking.

00:03:32.960 --> 00:03:34.710
Such a fresh sight.

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:37.750
I'm always fresh and ripe for the taking!

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:39.550
Oh, please.

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:44.510
So, by mountain vegetables, you mean
mushrooms and other wild greens, right?

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:46.220
I know next to nothing about them.

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:48.550
Rest assured.

00:03:48.550 --> 00:03:51.470
I am a qualified mountain vegetable advisor.

00:03:51.470 --> 00:03:54.310
Wow, that's impressive.

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:55.850
So admirable.

00:03:55.850 --> 00:03:57.400
You must be really talented.

00:03:57.400 --> 00:03:59.400
Don't praise me so much.

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:00.980
You're making my bum squeaky.

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:05.070
What was that sound?

00:04:10.370 --> 00:04:13.160
Hagimura, what's with that Suzu bell?

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:14.000
It's to keep bears away.

00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:18.840
The sound lets them know we're coming.

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:20.500
That way, we won't run into one.

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:23.380
It works on couples doing it outdoors, too.

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:25.760
I couldn't care less about them.

00:04:30.680 --> 00:04:32.890
Suzu's so cute.

00:04:38.310 --> 00:04:40.770
I want a Suzu.

00:04:45.240 --> 00:04:46.150
No way.

00:04:46.780 --> 00:04:48.280
Oh my.

00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:49.780
Over here.

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:52.160
You pluck it by tearing it off at the soft spot.

00:04:58.580 --> 00:05:00.250
Tsuda, isn't that too heavy?

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:00.750
Not at all.

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:03.500
I do a hundred push-ups every day!

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:06.800
So in other words,
you "work your arms" every day.

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:09.800
She's talking about jacking off.

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:11.510
I don't do that every day!

00:05:12.390 --> 00:05:15.100
These gaudy mushrooms look poisonous.

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:15.770
They're really red.

00:05:15.770 --> 00:05:17.140
These are...

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:19.520
actually edible, you know.

00:05:19.520 --> 00:05:20.860
They're slender Caesars.

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:21.770
Is that so?

00:05:21.770 --> 00:05:26.740
People often say that the gaudy ones are poisonous, whereas the plain ones are edible,

00:05:26.740 --> 00:05:28.610
but they're mistaken.

00:05:28.610 --> 00:05:31.780
When you're dealing with nature, you mustn't follow stereotypes.

00:05:32.120 --> 00:05:37.040
That said, I'd probably stuff any dark-ish mushroom I find into my mouth without hesitation.

00:05:38.580 --> 00:05:40.830
Now who's following stereotypes?

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:50.550
Looks like Tsuda found some
long, white mushrooms over there.

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:51.640
Oh?

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:55.140
Show me your mushroom, Tsuda.

00:05:55.140 --> 00:05:55.810
Shino-chan.

00:05:56.310 --> 00:05:58.730
That sounded a little vulgar, don't you think?

00:05:58.730 --> 00:06:00.560
You should probably be more specific.

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:02.060
How careless of me.

00:06:02.060 --> 00:06:06.230
T-Tsuda, could you show me your long, white mushroom?

00:06:06.230 --> 00:06:08.320
That's even worse.

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:12.570
It's getting rather cloudy.

00:06:13.320 --> 00:06:14.740
Not to mention foggy.

00:06:14.740 --> 00:06:16.830
It's affecting the visibility.

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:20.420
They do say the weather can
change rapidly up in the mountains.

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:22.330
This is bad.

00:06:22.330 --> 00:06:23.460
Fret not, everyone.

00:06:23.460 --> 00:06:26.710
We have a villa this way. Let's take shelter there.

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:28.340
Oh, maybe it's not so bad after all.

00:06:35.430 --> 00:06:39.100
You must be sweaty. Would you like
to take a bath before dinner?

00:06:39.100 --> 00:06:40.480
Sure.

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:44.440
While you're all in the bath, I'll wring the juice out of the mushrooms.

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:45.310
You will?

00:06:45.310 --> 00:06:46.730
Thanks.

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:51.490
Tsuda-kun says he'll wring his mushroom while we're taking a bath.

00:06:51.490 --> 00:06:52.910
O-Okay.

00:06:52.910 --> 00:06:54.160
We'd better not disturb him.

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:55.990
Give her the whole story!

00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:06.000
President.

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:08.460
Here's some shampoo.

00:07:08.460 --> 00:07:09.760
Oh, thanks.

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:12.220
Here's the hand shower.

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:14.010
Perfect timing.

00:07:14.390 --> 00:07:16.350
I was just thinking I needed some release.

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:18.510
Take it away from your crotch this instant!

00:07:18.510 --> 00:07:20.560
This feels really good.

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:23.440
Too hot!

00:07:23.440 --> 00:07:24.940
I'm outta here.

00:07:24.940 --> 00:07:26.520
We just got in.

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:28.690
Yeah, Kotomi.

00:07:28.690 --> 00:07:30.230
You've got to grin and bear it.

00:07:30.230 --> 00:07:33.990
If you get out now, you'll walk in
on Tsuda cranking his own turbine!

00:07:33.990 --> 00:07:36.200
Sorry, I forgot about that.

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:37.450
I'm <i>cooking</i> here, damn it.

00:07:38.910 --> 00:07:41.040
Wait, what am I even responding to?

00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:43.920
Now that we're all freshened up,

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:46.290
let's use the vegetables we
picked today to make dinner!

00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:49.500
Wild veggies are best consumed deep-fried.

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:52.550
That makes them less bitter,
and thus easier to eat.

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:54.840
You know a lot, Prez.

00:07:55.470 --> 00:07:57.720
On the other hand, I'm a total beginner.

00:08:00.260 --> 00:08:02.310
Does that apply to the bedroom too?

00:08:02.310 --> 00:08:04.850
There was no need to bring up
the bedroom now, right?

00:08:04.850 --> 00:08:05.310
<i>Right</i>?

00:08:06.270 --> 00:08:07.810
Let's eat!

00:08:08.270 --> 00:08:09.860
It's delicious.

00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:12.070
Tastes like Mother Nature.

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:15.070
Dejima-san found this for us.

00:08:15.070 --> 00:08:18.740
That's mizuna, a variety of
edible plant related to nettles.

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:20.950
Oh? Where'd you find it?

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:24.750
I spotted it right in front of me when I was peeing.

00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:25.960
It's not contaminated, right?

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:29.590
The mushroom rice is fantastic.

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:32.460
As is the mushroom soup.

00:08:32.880 --> 00:08:36.590
Whoever first ate a mushroom
must've had nerves of steel, though.

00:08:36.590 --> 00:08:37.470
I agree.

00:08:38.390 --> 00:08:42.970
Who in their right mind would want to eat amigasadake or onifusube?

00:08:43.850 --> 00:08:46.480
I guess we humans can't help
but satisfy our curiosity.

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:48.150
That goes for piss, too!

00:08:48.150 --> 00:08:50.610
This conversation sure took an extreme turn.

00:08:51.020 --> 00:08:53.110
Thanks for the food!

00:08:53.940 --> 00:08:54.780
Now, then.

00:08:54.780 --> 00:08:56.610
I have an important announcement to make.

00:08:56.610 --> 00:08:59.990
There are only two bedrooms in this villa!

00:09:00.620 --> 00:09:01.620
What?!

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:03.120
Oh dear.

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:05.120
This is a pickle.

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:06.790
I don't know who to choose.

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:09.130
Why do you even <i>get</i> to choose?

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:09.630
Oh, shut up.

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:12.960
I'll sleep in the living room, then.

00:09:12.960 --> 00:09:15.550
It'd be awful of us to
make you sleep here alone.

00:09:15.550 --> 00:09:17.340
Please learn to take a hint.

00:09:18.590 --> 00:09:21.390
Let's all sleep here, then.

00:09:21.930 --> 00:09:23.390
Doesn't that defeat the purpose?

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:27.730
Do you have someone you like?

00:09:27.730 --> 00:09:29.190
What is this, a school trip?

00:09:29.190 --> 00:09:30.190
Can we sleep now?

00:09:36.570 --> 00:09:38.950
Man, I'm totally out of shape.

00:09:39.780 --> 00:09:42.070
Just climbing the stairs makes my heart pound.

00:09:42.070 --> 00:09:43.700
That's pathetic, Tsuda.

00:09:45.370 --> 00:09:46.580
It did nothing to me!

00:09:48.290 --> 00:09:50.330
Or so I thought, but now my heart's pounding!

00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:54.880
Stop what you're doing
with your hand, for starters.

00:09:56.300 --> 00:09:57.880
Ousai, fight!

00:09:57.880 --> 00:09:58.420
Yeah!

00:09:58.420 --> 00:09:58.800
Fight!

00:09:58.800 --> 00:09:58.970
It's fall, the season for sports. How about trying something?
Fight!

00:09:58.970 --> 00:09:59.590
Yeah!
It's fall, the season for sports. How about trying something?

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:01.640
It's fall, the season for sports. How about trying something?

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:04.680
You'll also feel like you've achieved something. You'd be killing two birds with one stone!

00:10:05.430 --> 00:10:07.180
You're right.

00:10:07.180 --> 00:10:08.680
Something like jogging?

00:10:08.680 --> 00:10:10.350
Or walking?

00:10:10.350 --> 00:10:11.520
That's a relief.

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:13.360
It's not just me.

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:19.820
Masturbating wasn't mentioned because it makes you feel hollow instead, right?

00:10:19.820 --> 00:10:21.740
Nope.

00:10:21.740 --> 00:10:24.160
Uh, wait. Yeah, nope.

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:26.910
More! Say my name more!

00:10:28.910 --> 00:10:30.920
Hey! Show some discipline!

00:10:31.620 --> 00:10:34.710
You should be telling them off too, Ms. Yokoshima.

00:10:35.210 --> 00:10:36.420
How can I?

00:10:36.840 --> 00:10:40.510
If I say something, they'll just consider it
the ramblings of a bitter old woman.

00:10:40.510 --> 00:10:42.050
You're being too hard on yourself.

00:10:42.390 --> 00:10:48.060
The Student Council acts as the lost-and-found at this school.

00:10:48.470 --> 00:10:52.810
So, has anyone brought that thing I forgot here?

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:54.560
What did you forget?

00:10:55.020 --> 00:10:56.690
My math homework!

00:10:56.690 --> 00:10:59.440
It doesn't apply to something you forgot to <i>do</i>.

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:01.530
Figures.

00:11:01.530 --> 00:11:02.700
Face reality, will you?

00:11:03.610 --> 00:11:05.070
That reminds me.

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:09.250
Someone left their panties in the locker room.

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:10.960
Oh, those are mine.

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:16.790
I thought I'd start wearing them since it's
getting cold, but old habits die hard, huh?

00:11:16.790 --> 00:11:18.210
You'd <i>better</i> kick that habit.

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:21.720
Sheesh. At least write your name on them.

00:11:21.720 --> 00:11:24.260
I'm a bit old to be doing that in high school.

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:26.470
Stick a passport photo on them, then.

00:11:26.470 --> 00:11:27.890
I could manage that.

00:11:29.310 --> 00:11:30.520
Oh yeah, Tsuda.

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:32.810
I already checked the equipment for you.

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:34.100
Good work.

00:11:34.480 --> 00:11:35.600
Tsuda!

00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:39.280
That's what someone higher up
the totem pole says to their juniors.

00:11:40.070 --> 00:11:42.110
You should be saying "thank you."

00:11:42.650 --> 00:11:44.410
Sorry about that, Prez.

00:11:45.740 --> 00:11:47.070
Don't worry about it.

00:11:47.070 --> 00:11:50.040
A condescending word or two isn't all that bad.

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:51.450
She says she's okay with it.

00:11:51.450 --> 00:11:52.620
No. I'll be careful from now on.

00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:59.670
I will show you the true meaning of badminton!

00:11:59.670 --> 00:12:00.630
Bring it!

00:12:01.840 --> 00:12:04.430
While you're at it, why not
put something on the line?

00:12:04.430 --> 00:12:05.720
Easy there.

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:08.140
Student council members
shouldn't be doing anything immoral.

00:12:09.010 --> 00:12:11.640
Oh, we won't be betting anything significant.

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:12.390
Is that so?

00:12:12.810 --> 00:12:14.690
I get it! Your virginity, right?!

00:12:14.690 --> 00:12:16.900
Now <i>that's</i> totally immoral!

00:12:17.310 --> 00:12:20.230
Pick something that isn't immoral, then.

00:12:20.230 --> 00:12:21.650
Let's see...

00:12:21.650 --> 00:12:22.150
I know!

00:12:22.820 --> 00:12:25.400
I want that thing you were carrying when we went to that mountain the other day.

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:27.160
I want a Suzu.

00:12:29.530 --> 00:12:32.160
That Suzu was really cute.

00:12:41.340 --> 00:12:42.550
Sorry, Prez!

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:46.680
You think wings and wings attract?

00:12:46.680 --> 00:12:49.090
It's one of <i>those</i> days for you, is it?

00:12:49.090 --> 00:12:51.390
That makes no sense, so let's pretend it never happened.

00:12:56.730 --> 00:12:59.360
My hair's such a nuisance when I'm working.

00:12:59.360 --> 00:13:00.560
Guess I'll tie it up.

00:13:02.400 --> 00:13:04.490
Want me to lend you a ribbon?

00:13:05.610 --> 00:13:06.570
Look, it's cute.

00:13:06.950 --> 00:13:08.280
A ribbon, huh?

00:13:08.280 --> 00:13:09.570
Can't say I'm interested.

00:13:09.990 --> 00:13:11.580
Unless it's about wearing
nothing <i>but</i> a ribbon.

00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:13.830
If only you weren't interested in that either.

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:18.540
I'm going off to the staff room
to hand in this report.

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:19.170
Okay.

00:13:20.540 --> 00:13:23.170
I'm going off to the library
to look something up.

00:13:23.170 --> 00:13:23.920
Okay.

00:13:25.340 --> 00:13:26.220
Shino-chan.

00:13:26.720 --> 00:13:28.930
I'm turned on, so I'll be
getting off in the washroom.

00:13:28.930 --> 00:13:30.970
You don't need to tell me about that!

00:13:31.800 --> 00:13:33.470
A MOMENT OF BOREDOM...
A MOMENT OF BOREDOM...

00:13:34.430 --> 00:13:36.810
I thought of a new way to flash!

00:13:37.890 --> 00:13:39.900
I'm bored, so let's hear it.

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:46.070
I actually just turned up my skirt!

00:13:46.070 --> 00:13:48.110
What do you think? Isn't it thrilling?

00:13:48.650 --> 00:13:50.990
I'm bored, but that was
a complete waste of time.

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:03.250
That should be most of the jack-o'-lanterns done.

00:14:03.250 --> 00:14:06.880
Yeah, but I spent half a day straight on this,

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:09.130
so my hand's pretty much had it.

00:14:09.630 --> 00:14:11.390
My throat's had it too.

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:13.800
Every time Tsuda-kun was carving out a pumpkin,

00:14:13.800 --> 00:14:18.350
I was yelling out, "Please don't be so rough! I'll bweak!"

00:14:18.350 --> 00:14:20.270
I'm amazed you lasted that long.

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:25.270
By the way, Aria.

00:14:25.270 --> 00:14:27.440
Weren't you in the snacks group?

00:14:27.440 --> 00:14:31.360
I ended up getting heartburn
after baking them for a while,

00:14:31.360 --> 00:14:33.030
so I took a break.

00:14:33.030 --> 00:14:35.410
I see. Feeling better?

00:14:35.410 --> 00:14:36.410
Yes, thank you.

00:14:36.410 --> 00:14:38.160
Please wear a bra, by the way.

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:40.000
I can't get enough of
how it feels without one.

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:43.710
What do you think of this?

00:14:45.790 --> 00:14:48.130
It's a bit too revealing.

00:14:48.130 --> 00:14:49.170
Tights, maybe?

00:14:51.380 --> 00:14:53.970
But tights could end up showing the outline of one's panties.

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:56.350
How about wearing a thong...

00:14:56.930 --> 00:15:01.690
N-No! I didn't say that because
I had dirty intentions or anything!

00:15:02.730 --> 00:15:03.690
Relax. We understand.

00:15:04.310 --> 00:15:07.900
You rather watch a girl
unwedge herself, wouldn't you?

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:10.190
I'd rather you didn't understand me so well.

00:15:12.240 --> 00:15:13.320
My!

00:15:13.820 --> 00:15:15.740
Instant!

00:15:15.740 --> 00:15:16.990
Wonderful!

00:15:19.660 --> 00:15:22.540
It says "rich and hearty" on the cover,

00:15:22.540 --> 00:15:24.540
but there's barely anything but soup.

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:25.330
Hardly any meat.

00:15:25.330 --> 00:15:26.380
Hey, Tsuda!

00:15:26.380 --> 00:15:28.000
Watch your tongue!

00:15:28.550 --> 00:15:31.380
Hagimura hardly has any meat on her bones yet either!

00:15:31.880 --> 00:15:35.140
Someone here clearly isn't watching <i>her</i> tongue!

00:15:41.310 --> 00:15:43.770
That lunch wasn't nearly filling enough.

00:15:43.770 --> 00:15:45.520
Y-You can have this!

00:15:46.400 --> 00:15:48.270
Don't get the wrong idea, okay?

00:15:48.270 --> 00:15:50.190
I just ended up making too many snacks!

00:15:50.190 --> 00:15:52.280
It's not like I made it for you or anything!

00:15:52.280 --> 00:15:54.450
Gee, thanks.

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:56.570
Was that good enough, Chiri?

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:03.080
Things have gotten so hectic that I'm totally stressed out.

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:04.790
You can have this!

00:16:05.420 --> 00:16:07.710
D-Don't get the wrong idea, okay?

00:16:07.710 --> 00:16:10.920
I just happened to make two for myself.

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:12.970
It's not like I made it for you or anything!

00:16:12.970 --> 00:16:14.970
What am I even supposed to do with this thing?

00:16:16.010 --> 00:16:19.140
Oh, Prez. Your Halloween costume's ready?

00:16:19.140 --> 00:16:22.060
Nah. It's not complete yet.

00:16:22.060 --> 00:16:23.730
What's missing?

00:16:24.060 --> 00:16:26.270
A groin protector!

00:16:26.270 --> 00:16:29.900
So that I don't get turned on
when I straddle this.

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:32.110
How about building up some self-control?

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:46.370
So you're a pumpkin monster, Suzu-chan?

00:16:48.170 --> 00:16:51.000
Your costume's perfect, Suzu-senpai!

00:16:53.010 --> 00:16:56.380
Suzu-senpai!

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:03.140
How can people tell it's me
even though I'm wearing this?

00:17:04.930 --> 00:17:06.390
H-How, indeed?

00:17:06.890 --> 00:17:11.270
Apparently the drama club's
looking for the curtain for their play.

00:17:12.270 --> 00:17:14.530
Taka-nii! Prez! Where are you going?

00:17:14.530 --> 00:17:16.530
I need to go find the curtain.

00:17:17.910 --> 00:17:20.120
What, so you can uncover my evil plans?

00:17:20.120 --> 00:17:21.530
No, this isn't about you.

00:17:21.530 --> 00:17:23.540
<b>The Next Day</b>

00:17:31.670 --> 00:17:33.340
What's wrong, Aria?

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:36.010
It's a bit tight.

00:17:36.010 --> 00:17:38.340
Is that outfit not the right size for you?

00:17:38.800 --> 00:17:40.470
I meant the turtle-shell bondage web.

00:17:40.470 --> 00:17:42.510
That's it? You nearly gave me
a heart attack there!

00:17:42.510 --> 00:17:44.350
This <i>should</i> be giving you a heart attack!

00:17:44.890 --> 00:17:46.930
So you're playing Dracula, Tsuda-kun.

00:17:46.930 --> 00:17:47.600
Yeah.

00:17:48.100 --> 00:17:53.110
For having such a scary image,
Dracula sure has a lot of weaknesses.

00:17:53.110 --> 00:17:54.480
Like sunlight,

00:17:54.480 --> 00:17:55.860
garlic,

00:17:56.740 --> 00:17:57.780
and even crosses!

00:17:58.110 --> 00:18:01.530
Yeah, that last one's a real killer.

00:18:02.370 --> 00:18:04.160
It makes you unable to use the Cross position!

00:18:04.160 --> 00:18:06.040
That's supposed to be important?

00:18:09.460 --> 00:18:11.330
That was too many sweets.

00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:12.960
I can't eat anymore.

00:18:12.960 --> 00:18:14.920
I can still go.

00:18:15.670 --> 00:18:16.800
Tada!

00:18:17.300 --> 00:18:22.550
Then please try this all-new
pumpkin cream puff!

00:18:26.470 --> 00:18:27.680
Seafood?

00:18:27.680 --> 00:18:30.020
I was shooting for a <i>real</i> cream experience.

00:18:30.020 --> 00:18:31.310
<i>What</i> experience?

00:18:34.520 --> 00:18:35.520
Here you go.

00:18:35.520 --> 00:18:37.690
Pumpkin cookies.

00:18:38.740 --> 00:18:41.200
You can have one, Ms. Pumpkin!

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:42.240
Oh, no thanks.

00:18:42.240 --> 00:18:45.280
I'm on student council duty right now.

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:47.290
Hagimura...

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:50.080
You shouldn't crush a kid's dreams.

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:52.710
Get into the role.

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:53.460
Right.

00:18:54.330 --> 00:18:56.800
No, thanks. That's part of my own body.

00:18:56.800 --> 00:18:58.170
Feel free to eat it yourself.

00:18:58.710 --> 00:19:00.220
Now you're <i>too</i> into the role.

00:19:02.130 --> 00:19:04.340
Oh, are you taking pictures?

00:19:04.340 --> 00:19:06.810
Would you like me to take one?

00:19:06.810 --> 00:19:08.220
Please do.

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:13.980
Hey! Tell us to say "cheese" beforehand!

00:19:13.980 --> 00:19:15.230
We weren't ready.

00:19:16.900 --> 00:19:20.400
But cheese brings to mind <i>that</i> smell,

00:19:20.400 --> 00:19:22.240
so I was merely being considerate.

00:19:22.240 --> 00:19:26.620
What's with that face? You're acting like
what I said was totally unexpected.

00:19:30.040 --> 00:19:31.160
Huh?

00:19:31.160 --> 00:19:32.500
Oh?

00:19:32.500 --> 00:19:36.210
Did you get into the Halloween spirit too, Disciplinary Chief?

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:37.000
Well...

00:19:38.130 --> 00:19:40.840
This costume's from the choir club.

00:19:41.880 --> 00:19:44.090
That's quite the lewd outfit.

00:19:44.090 --> 00:19:44.890
How?!

00:19:45.640 --> 00:19:50.100
Just seeing a goody-two-shoes in a
different outfit is enough to turn people on!

00:19:50.100 --> 00:19:51.890
Maybe I should change.

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:53.640
Oh dear.

00:19:53.640 --> 00:19:54.650
Rain?

00:19:58.820 --> 00:20:03.320
Prez, what about the costume contest? We were supposed to have it outdoors.

00:20:03.900 --> 00:20:06.530
The drama club already have the gym.

00:20:06.530 --> 00:20:07.740
Settle down, Tsuda.

00:20:08.160 --> 00:20:10.660
When facing an unforeseen situation,

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:12.500
what one needs to have is a broad mind!

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:16.500
By the way, I left my laundry drying at home,

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:19.630
but I think that's still okay since panties are made to get wet!

00:20:20.090 --> 00:20:21.300
Oh?

00:20:21.300 --> 00:20:22.510
It seems to be letting up.

00:20:22.510 --> 00:20:25.220
All right! Time for the costume contest!

00:20:25.220 --> 00:20:27.010
Here's the Judo Club!

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:30.510
Here are the teachers in costumes!

00:20:30.510 --> 00:20:34.520
Here's the Robot Research Club President, Todoroki-san, playing Medusa!

00:20:37.940 --> 00:20:39.520
And the winners are...

00:20:39.520 --> 00:20:42.320
the Judo Club!

00:20:46.570 --> 00:20:47.490
Wow, Tokki.

00:20:47.490 --> 00:20:50.160
It's not often I see you
playing along with such things.

00:20:50.160 --> 00:20:51.740
Yeah, though I can't be bothered.

00:20:51.740 --> 00:20:53.660
But come on, you have to cosplay.

00:20:53.660 --> 00:20:54.710
I am.

00:20:55.460 --> 00:20:56.540
Take a look.

00:20:57.250 --> 00:20:58.920
Sorry I didn't notice.

00:21:05.880 --> 00:21:07.050
Good work!

00:21:07.050 --> 00:21:08.590
Good work.

00:21:08.590 --> 00:21:10.850
It's always so sad when a festival comes to an end.

00:21:11.180 --> 00:21:12.680
Yeah.

00:21:12.680 --> 00:21:15.390
I put a lot of effort into making this outfit too,

00:21:15.390 --> 00:21:16.980
so I don't want to take it off.

00:21:17.440 --> 00:21:18.600
What?!

00:21:18.600 --> 00:21:19.700
Huh?

00:22:52.490 --> 00:22:54.450
Another day of hard work.

00:22:54.450 --> 00:22:57.040
There are a bunch of events in fall, after all.

00:22:57.490 --> 00:23:00.500
Oh, right. I'm supposed to
do the groceries today.

00:23:00.500 --> 00:23:02.500
What's Kotomi doing?

00:23:03.750 --> 00:23:05.340
Well, we might as well tag along.

00:23:05.340 --> 00:23:06.460
Thanks.

00:23:07.000 --> 00:23:10.050
Wow, that's crazy.

00:23:11.220 --> 00:23:13.470
Wow, this is crazy.

00:23:13.470 --> 00:23:16.680
I never expected to see two <i>mushrooms</i> rubbing against each other in public.

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:18.720
That's not the response I want!

00:23:21.440 --> 00:23:22.600
Dejima Sayaka here.

00:23:22.600 --> 00:23:23.900
Winter begins next episode.

00:23:23.900 --> 00:23:25.860
The season when flashing outdoors becomes complicated.

00:23:25.860 --> 00:23:27.070
It's complicated all year round!

00:23:27.070 --> 00:23:31.320
We'll mainly be covering
chapters 164 and 165 in volume 7.

00:23:31.650 --> 00:23:34.240
I guess wearing a blindfold makes it
possible to flash even in winter.

00:23:34.240 --> 00:23:35.990
It'll warm your eyes,
but that's still a no!
